WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.675 --> 00:00:05.438
Fatahaadda biyaha roobabka ama wabiyada waxay daacuunka gaarsiin karaan ceelasha,

2
00:00:05.475 --> 00:00:08.000
barkadaha, baliyada iyo haamaha biyaha.

3
00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:11.825
Daacuunku wuxuu ku faafaa biyo iyo cunto wasakh ah,

4
00:00:11.825 --> 00:00:14.900
wuxuuna qofka dili karaa dhowr saacadood gudahood.

5
00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:18.988
Laakiin waa laga hortagi karaa, waana la daaweyn karaa.

6
00:00:19.813 --> 00:00:23.750
Daacuunka waxaad uga taxadari kartaa ugana ilaalin kartaa naftaada,

7
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.475
qoyskaaga iyo ehelkaagaba sida soo socota.

8
00:00:28.263 --> 00:00:32.038
Jeermiska daacuunku wuxuu ku nool yahay saxarada dadka uu ku dhacay.

9
00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.675
Marka biyaha fatahaadda ama musqulaha buuxsamay ay gaaraan ceelasha, barkadaha,

10
00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:41.200
baliyada, haamaha iyo cuntada, jeermisku wuu galayaa.

11
00:00:41.975 --> 00:00:46.263
Inta badan dadka caba biyahaas waxaa ku dhaca xanuun fudud ama kuma dhaco,

12
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.325
laakiin weli way faafin karaan.

13
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.075
Dadka qaar baa aad u xanuunsada,

14
00:00:51.075 --> 00:00:54.600
oo waxaa ku dhaca shuban biyo ah oo degdeg ah iyo matag.

15
00:00:56.307 --> 00:00:59.357
Marka hore, biyaha la cabbo ka dhig kuwo nadiif ah.

16
00:01:00.119 --> 00:01:05.082
Biyaha karkari ilaa ay si xoog leh u karkaraan, oo ay ka soo baxdo xumbo waaweyn,

17
00:01:05.082 --> 00:01:07.507
kadibna ha qaboobaan iyagoo daboolan.

18
00:01:08.282 --> 00:01:09.857
Haddii aadan karkarin karin,

19
00:01:09.857 --> 00:01:14.657
isticmaal kiniinnada nadiifinta biyaha adoo u isticmaalaya sida baakadda ku qoran.

20
00:01:15.457 --> 00:01:20.207
Biyo nadiif ah u isticmaal cabbitaanka, karinta, cadayga iyo cuntada ilmaha.

21
00:01:21.975 --> 00:01:25.363
Biyaha nadiifka ah ku kaydi weel nadiif ah oo dabool leh.

22
00:01:26.113 --> 00:01:28.125
Ka shub, ama ka isticmaal tuubada.

23
00:01:28.975 --> 00:01:33.150
Weligaa gacantaada, ama koob wasakh ah, ha dhex galin biyaha kaydsan.

24
00:01:34.923 --> 00:01:38.448
Marka labaad, gacmaha ku dhaq saabuun iyo biyo nadiif ah.

25
00:01:39.223 --> 00:01:41.061
Gacmaha qoy, oo saabuun mari.

26
00:01:41.886 --> 00:01:44.761
Xoq meel kasta: calaacalaha, dhabarka gacmaha,

27
00:01:44.761 --> 00:01:47.236
faraha dhexdooda iyo ciddiyaha hoostooda.

28
00:01:48.036 --> 00:01:50.686
Biyo ku maydh, oo ha ku engegaan hawada.

29
00:01:51.498 --> 00:01:56.411
Samee marka aad musqusha ka soo baxdo, marka aad ilmo nadiifiso, ka hor karinta,

30
00:01:56.411 --> 00:01:58.936
iyo ka hor cunista ama quudinta ilmaha.

31
00:02:00.711 --> 00:02:03.224
Marka saddexaad, saxarada ka fogee biyaha.

32
00:02:04.049 --> 00:02:07.749
Mar walba isticmaal musqul, weligaa dhul bannaan ha isticmaalin,

33
00:02:07.749 --> 00:02:09.736
musqulahana ka fogee ceelasha.

34
00:02:10.524 --> 00:02:14.474
Saxarada carruurta sidoo kale ku rid musqusha, kadibna gacmaha dhaq.

35
00:02:16.203 --> 00:02:18.853
Marka afraad, cuntada ka dhig mid nadiif ah.

36
00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:22.616
Cuntada si fiican u kari, oo cun iyadoo kulul.

37
00:02:23.378 --> 00:02:26.978
Khudaarta ku dhaq biyo nadiif ah oo diir, cuntadana dabool.

38
00:02:28.707 --> 00:02:32.419
Haddii qof qabo shuban biyo ah, si degdeg ah talaabo u qaad.

39
00:02:33.169 --> 00:02:36.132
Isla markiiba bilow inaad siisid daawada ORS.

40
00:02:36.144 --> 00:02:39.557
Hal baakad ku qas biyo nadiif ah sida baakadda ku qoran,

41
00:02:39.557 --> 00:02:41.869
oo ha u qaato si yar yar marar badan.

42
00:02:42.644 --> 00:02:47.819
Si degdeg ah u tag xarun caafimaad, gaar ahaan haddii qofku aad uu daciif u yahay,

43
00:02:47.819 --> 00:02:50.532
uusan cabbi karin, ama uu yahay ilmo yar.

44
00:02:51.319 --> 00:02:55.582
Dadka badankoodu waxay ku bogsadaan daawada ORS oo degdeg loo siiyo.

45
00:02:57.363 --> 00:03:02.801
Waxaad tagtaa meesha shaqaalaha caafimaadku ku bixiyaan tallaalka daacuunka ee afka laga qaato,

46
00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:06.363
qaado, oo sii wad karkarinta biyaha iyo dhaqidda gacmaha.

47
00:03:07.176 --> 00:03:10.626
Biyo nadiif ah, gacmo nadiif ah, ORS degdeg ah.

48
00:03:11.388 --> 00:03:12.688
La wadaag qoyskaaga.
